        <article data-uid="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console">
  
  
  <h1 id="GameFramework_ConsoleTool_Console" data-uid="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console" class="text-break">
    Class Console
    
  </h1>
  
  <div class="facts text-secondary">
    <dl><dt>Namespace</dt><dd><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.html">GameFramework.ConsoleTool</a></dd></dl>
    <dl><dt>Assembly</dt><dd>cs.temp.dll.dll</dd></dl>
  </div>
  
  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Core console system that manages command execution, history, and output.</p>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="4" sourceendlinenumber="4">Architecture:</p>
<ul sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="8">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="5">Static class for global access (consider making non-static in future for better testability)</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="6" sourceendlinenumber="6">Manages command queue, history, and execution</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="7" sourceendlinenumber="7">Delegates UI operations to registered IConsoleUI implementation</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="8" sourceendlinenumber="8">Thread-safe command queuing for commands from other threads</li>
</ul>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="10" sourceendlinenumber="10">Command Execution Flow:</p>
<ol sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="14">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="11">Commands are queued via EnqueueCommand()</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="12" sourceendlinenumber="12">ConsoleUpdate() processes the queue each frame</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="13" sourceendlinenumber="13">Commands are tokenized and looked up in registry</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="14" sourceendlinenumber="14">Command execution results are output to console</li>
</ol>
</div>
  <div class="markdown conceptual"></div>

  <div class="codewrapper">
    <pre><code class="lang-csharp hljs">public static class Console</code></pre>
  </div>
  
  
  
  
